# Protect CI workflows, custom actions, and the DevCouncil PR Gate action
# definition so pull requests cannot weaken branch protection, request write
# permissions on untrusted branches, or forge `devcouncil/pr-gate` statuses.
#
# Repository branch-protection requirements for this file to take effect:
#   1. Enable "Require a pull request before merging" + "Require review from
#      Code Owners" on the default branch.
#   2. Note: GitHub does not allow a single listed owner to approve their own
#      pull requests; add a second maintainer or maintainer team here once
#      onboarding additional maintainers.
/.github/CODEOWNERS    @bharathvbcr
/.github/workflows/**  @bharathvbcr
/.github/actions/**    @bharathvbcr
/action.yml            @bharathvbcr
